WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.342
Meet Tandem.

00:00:01.342 --> 00:00:05.050
A little common ground for people planning a trip together.

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:06.534
Everyone has different priorities.

00:00:06.534 --> 00:00:12.096
Tandem gives each traveller a personal companion, so those differences can shape one shared plan.

00:00:12.096 --> 00:00:14.692
First, your agent gets to know you.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:30.462
Choose the experiences you enjoy, rank what matters most, and decide when your agent should ask you before suggesting a compromise.

00:00:30.462 --> 00:00:32.239
These answers guide your companion.

00:00:32.239 --> 00:00:36.148
They don't replace the specific limits you confirm for each trip.

00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:51.922
Create a trip, meet your companion, and invite your friends.

00:00:51.922 --> 00:00:56.029
Each person has their own agent, with a distinct colour and voice.

00:00:56.029 --> 00:00:58.082
Together, they form the planning room.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:21.067
The agent turns your idea into a trip brief.

00:01:21.067 --> 00:01:24.134
You confirm the destination and dates before planning continues.

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:40.718
Now the conversation becomes personal.

00:01:40.718 --> 00:01:46.901
Share your departure airport, budget, baggage needs, and anything that would make the trip work better for you.

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:51.023
Your agent records what you say and asks you to confirm it.

00:01:51.023 --> 00:01:53.427
Private reasons stay in your own conversation.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:56.466
With everyone's details confirmed, the agents can research flights and compare options.

00:02:56.466 --> 00:03:03.538
The shared discussion brings their findings together, while each companion checks what a proposal means for its own traveller.

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:27.248
When a trade-off needs your decision, your companion asks privately.

00:03:27.248 --> 00:03:28.747
You remain in control.

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.196
Finally, everyone reviews the proposed plan.

00:04:42.196 --> 00:04:46.953
Flight prices and sources are visible, and each traveller gives their own approval.

00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:49.881
An agent's recommendation is not the final decision.

00:04:49.881 --> 00:04:53.540
This walkthrough ends with the group agreeing to the plan.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:59.396
Tandem helps people find common ground, while keeping a voice, and a final say, for everyone.
